          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " at the two curved ends, growing the oval to 60 x 40 cm over 5 rounds."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use 8 to 10 mm cotton or recycled cotton rope. The rope weight gives the mat enough body to stay flat. Total yarn around 400 m."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
