        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Base"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chain 31 cm. Round 1: dc along both sides, 3 dc at each short end (about 50 dc). Rounds 2 to 5: add 8 dc per round at both curved ends. By round 5 the mat is 60 x 40 cm."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sl st to close final round. Fasten off. Weave in ends firmly. Lay flat and allow to settle. Machine wash 40 degrees."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
